According to the branch''s own page on McDonald''s South Africa''s official website, The Junxion restaurant trades from 08:00 to 20:00 on Mondays and from 07:00 to 22:00 on every other day of the week, giving it longer hours than a typical single-shift takeaway. It suits families, commuters and shoppers in Philippi looking for a quick, familiar meal before or after visiting the mall, whether ordering at the drive-thru, collecting a takeaway or sitting down with the children for a Happy Meal.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://www.mcdonalds.co.za/location/mcdonalds-the-junxion'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'mcdonalds-the-junxion-philippi' AND description = 'McDonald''s The Junxion is a drive-thru fast-food restaurant inside The Junxion Mall, serving the chain''s usual burger, chicken and breakfast menu to the Philippi area.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
  AND owner_user_id IS NULL AND COALESCE(subscription_tier, 0) = 0 AND COALESCE(origin, '') != 'owner_submitted'
  AND status = 'published' AND closed_at IS NULL AND is_test = 0
  AND custom_blocks IS NULL AND page_html IS NULL
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM business_claims c WHERE c.business_id = businesses.id)
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM subscriptions s WHERE s.business_id = businesses.id)
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM business_photos p WHERE p.business_id = businesses.id);
-- melomed-bellville-pharmacy-bellville (researched)
