The pharmacy is one of several Melopharm branches operating inside Melomed''s network of hospitals across the Cape Peninsula, giving it access to the group''s wider stock and clinical support while still serving walk-in customers directly. According to Melomed''s own pharmacy page, the Bellville branch trades Monday to Friday from 08:00 to 19:00, and on Saturdays, Sundays and public holidays from 10:00 to 14:00. It suits Melomed Bellville patients, hospital visitors and the surrounding Bellville community needing prescription medicines or pharmacy advice close to the hospital.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://www.melomed.co.za/services/melomed_pharmacy.asp?m=Melomed+Pharmacies'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'melomed-bellville-pharmacy-bellville' AND description = 'Melomed Bellville Pharmacy is a branch of the Melomed pharmacy group, located at the corner of Voortrekker Road and A J West Street in Bellville.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
